{"5190580":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"HELENA : Cloud District","steam_appid":5190580,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore the remnants of a mega-structure<\/strong> in search of mysterious plants. <strong>Use the camera to capture them<\/strong>, and bring your photographs back to the computer at the heart of this dormant world. <strong>Complete the collection<\/strong> and find all pictures to get a glimpse of a forgotten story. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5190580\/extras\/8825b19a2914bc08350ea9aa970193a2.poster.avif?t=1793300989\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5190580\/extras\/8825b19a2914bc08350ea9aa970193a2.webm?t=1793300989\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5190580\/extras\/8825b19a2914bc08350ea9aa970193a2.mp4?t=1793300989\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Slide, hover, and glide through the structure<\/strong> in your own creative way in order to reach every level and get deeper into the slumbering Cloud District. There is no single way to roam through the edifice, <strong>make your own path.<\/strong>  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5190580\/extras\/1411cf5b597b121ca91761658876fd1a.poster.avif?t=1793300989\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5190580\/extras\/1411cf5b597b121ca91761658876fd1a.webm?t=1793300989\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets